              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Traditional Transport:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Donkey carts are a common and traditional mode of transport for locals."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Unique Experience:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Offering a slower, more scenic way to travel, they can add an amusing twist to your journey."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Local Interaction:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Some cart drivers speak English and can provide a more interactive experience, though be prepared for some haggling."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
