              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Motorcycles"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Faster Option:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " For those looking for speed, motorbikes are also available for rent."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Rental Locations:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Available next to Al-Babinshal Hotel or at Palm Trees Hotel."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Considerations:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Motorbikes offer less tranquility compared to bicycles but can be more efficient for longer distances."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Servees (Pick-up Trucks)"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Communal Taxis:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Serve as a shared taxi service, connecting Siwa Town with surrounding villages."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Pricing:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Costs range from E£20-E£30 for farther destinations like Bilad ar-Rum; closer areas cost about 50pt."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Private Hire:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " For remote locations, consider hiring a private truck. Assistance can be sought from the tourist office or directly from drivers at the petrol station."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000025",
