            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In summary, Siwa Oasis provides a range of transport options to suit various preferences. Whether you prefer the leisurely pace of a bicycle or donkey cart, the speed of a motorcycle, or the convenience of a communal taxi, each mode of transport offers a unique way to experience the charm and beauty of Siwa."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
